OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 20 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe Ulster Orchestra is joined by
OL,6,     Ga stellar line-up of soloists for
OL,7,     GStravinsky's witty Pulcinella and
OL,8,     Ga performance of Schubert's
OL,9,     Gmajestic Symphony No. 9, The
OL,10,     GGreat.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,12,     FSt
OL,13,     GDr Rommi Smith examines a turning-
OL,14,     Gpoint moment of five Black female
OL,15,     Gmusicians, revealing lesser-known
OL,16,     Gaspects of their life and work.
OL,17,     GToday she considers Billie
OL,18,     GHoliday in love.
